 "continuesQuestionOf": null,
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "bekhorot.44b.13",
   "daf": "44b",
   "sentenceId": 12,
   "he": "וְעַד כַּמָּה? מַחְוֵי רַב יְהוּדָה: עַד רְכוּבָּה. תַּנְיָא, רַבִּי אֱלִיעֶזֶר בֶּן יַעֲקֹב אוֹמֵר: עַד רְכוּבָּה — פָּסוּל, לְמַעְלָה מִן רְכוּבָּה — כָּשֵׁר. אִיכָּא דְּאָמְרִי: עַד רְכוּבָּה — כָּשֵׁר, לְמַטָּה מִן הָרְכוּבָּה — פָּסוּל.",
   "en": "The Gemara asks: «And how much» is considered too long, which disqualifies the priest from performing the Temple service? «Rav Yehuda pointed» and said: «Until» the «knee. It is» likewise «taught» in a baraita that «Rabbi Eliezer ben Ya’akov says:» If one’s penis reaches «until» his «knee» he is «disqualified» from performing the Temple service. But if it reaches until just «above» his «knee» he remains «fit. Some say» if his penis reaches «until» the «knee» he is «fit,» but if it passes «below the knee» he is «disqualified.»"
  }
 ],
